<title>HONG KONG: M.C. Packaging interim net down 57 pct.</title>
<headline>M.C. Packaging interim net down 57 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   4.6    vs 11.4</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    1.5    vs 4.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    30.28  vs 70.61</p>
<p>    Turnover		     840.64 vs 770.10</p>
<p>    Company name		 M.C. Packaging (Hong Kong) Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  November 13-19</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   November 20</p>
<p>NOTE - M.C. Packaging makes cans and bottles.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6368</p>
